{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04110","headline":"奉和圣制幸韦嗣立庄应制 · 苏頲","name":"奉和圣制幸韦嗣立庄应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"树色参差隐翠微，泉流百尺向空飞。\n传闻此处投竿住，遂使兹辰扈跸归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}